{
  "_comment": [
    "The oracle corpus (AR-VER-209, docs/quality/VERIFICATION_PLAN.md): programs run in Arare and in the pinned",
    "Ajisai build, compared by scripts/check-oracle.mjs. `tolerance` is the largest absolute error allowed",
    "between Arare's result and Ajisai's exact one, as a rational; until Phase 3 infers error budgets it is",
    "worked out by hand from the rounding points the program passes through. A case with `divergence` is one",
    "where Arare differs from Ajisai on purpose (ADR-0007): the harness checks that Arare answers `arare`",
    "and that Ajisai still answers something else."
